--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository contains two independently licensed bodies of work, both
covered by the MIT license above:

  example_src/    marketd, an example service written for teaching purposes
  codegraph/      a deterministic multi-root code knowledge graph and
                  coding-assistant plugin

codegraph interoperates with third-party graph extraction backends by invoking
them as separate, separately installed programs. It does not vendor, bundle, or
redistribute their source code, and no third-party code is included in this
repository. Their licenses are reproduced in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md for the
convenience of anyone installing them via `make install`, and those licenses
govern those programs — not this one.
